{"id":"H0169","lemma":"אֹ֫הֶל","transliteration":"ohel","sayIt":"o-hel","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ohel","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.3.20;\nson of: Zerubbabel (H2216);\nbrother of: Meshullam (H4918H), Hananiah (H2608L), Shelomith (H8019I), Hashubah (H2807), Berechiah (H1296), Hasadiah (H2619), Jushab-hesed (H3142), Abiud (G0010)\n§ Ohel = \"tent\"\nson of Zerubbabel","glosses":["ohel"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-3","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ohel","kjv":"and Ohel"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 3:20","note":"and Hashubah, Ohel, Berechiah, Hasadiah, and Jushab Hesed, five.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H2216","lemma":"זְרֻבָּבֶ֫ל","transliteration":"zerubbavel","gloss":"Zerubbabel"},{"id":"H4918","lemma":"מְשֻׁלָּם","transliteration":"meshullam","gloss":"Meshullam"},{"id":"H2608","lemma":"חֲנַנְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"chananyah","gloss":"Hananiah"},{"id":"H8019","lemma":"שְׁלֹמִית","transliteration":"shelomit","gloss":"Shelomith"},{"id":"H2807","lemma":"חֲשֻׁבָה","transliteration":"chashuvah","gloss":"Hashubah"},{"id":"H1296","lemma":"בֶּרֶכְיָה","transliteration":"berekhyah","gloss":"Berechiah"},{"id":"H2619","lemma":"חֲסַדְיָה","transliteration":"chasadyah","gloss":"Hasadiah"},{"id":"H3142","lemma":"י֥וּשַׁב חֶ֖סֶד","transliteration":"yushav chesed","gloss":"Jushab-hesed"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}